MidPoint 4.11 "Čapek" Update 1
----------------------

Release 4.11.1 is an eighty-ninth midPoint release code-named Čapek.
The 4.11.1 release brings AI-assisted rapid application onboarding, major security improvements, and numerous improvements for end users, engineers, and administrators.

Release date: 27th November 2026
Release type: Feature release
End of support: 20th October 2028

Please see the release notes for detailed list of changes:
https://docs.evolveum.com/midpoint/release/4.11.1/
